---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Compare AI agent repositories — PARADOX" description="Compare two public AI agent repositories by freshness, health, documentation, stack and static risk indicators." canonical="https://paradox.engineer/compare/">
  <main class="compare-page">
    <header>
      <span>COMPARE / SIDE BY SIDE / 01</span>
      <h1>Two agents.<br /><em>Same evidence.</em></h1>
      <p class="page-lead">Paste two public GitHub repositories. Missing fields stay Unknown. Nothing is invented.</p>
    </header>
    <form id="compareForm">
      <label class="visually-hidden" for="repoA">First repository</label>
      <input id="repoA" type="text" placeholder="https://github.com/owner/repo" required />
      <label class="visually-hidden" for="repoB">Second repository</label>
      <input id="repoB" type="text" placeholder="https://github.com/owner/repo" required />
      <button type="submit">Compare</button>
    </form>
    <div id="compareStatus" class="status" role="status"></div>
    <section class="pv-compare-stage" aria-label="Comparison preview">
      <article class="pv-repo-card"><span>01 / REPOSITORY A</span><h2>Evidence snapshot</h2><p>Freshness, stack, activity, documentation and static risk signals are normalized into comparable evidence.</p><div class="pv-score-row"><div class="pv-score"><span>FRESHNESS</span><b>—</b></div><div class="pv-score"><span>HEALTH</span><b>—</b></div><div class="pv-score"><span>RISK</span><b>—</b></div></div></article>
      <div class="pv-vs">VS</div>
      <article class="pv-repo-card"><span>02 / REPOSITORY B</span><h2>Evidence snapshot</h2><p>The comparison remains evidence-first: missing fields stay Unknown instead of being guessed.</p><div class="pv-score-row"><div class="pv-score"><span>FRESHNESS</span><b>—</b></div><div class="pv-score"><span>HEALTH</span><b>—</b></div><div class="pv-score"><span>RISK</span><b>—</b></div></div></article>
    </section>
    <section id="compareResult" hidden></section>
  </main>
  <script>
    import '../../scripts/compare-page.ts';
  </script>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.visually-hidden{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}
</style>
